  "body": "[https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/parsing.html#numeric-character-reference-end-state](Numeric Character Reference End State): \"If the number is 0x0D or a control, but not ASCII whitespace, then this is a control-character-reference parse error.\"\r\n\r\nThat sentence seems to say \"if 0x0D is not whitespace, it's forbidden\". Let's clarify the intended meaning.",
